  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>)</mo><mtext>&#160;lies on&#160;</mtext><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Normal at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>so equation of normal is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;</p>"
